{
  "story": "ST-ID-002",
  "notes": "Non-secret desired SHAPE of the first-family human identities. Names, emails and passwords are operational input stored only in DPAPI files on valhalla, never in Git or evidence. Authentik authenticates; SETOK Family (not Authentik) will model family membership and roles.",
  "operationalInput": "%LOCALAPPDATA%\\SETOK\\setok-family\\st-id-002-identities.xml (DPAPI CurrentUser)",
